    },
    "This is a service code (for example call forwarding). Press Return again to send it to your phone.": {
      "comment": "Inline warning in the popover when typed or pasted text is a service code containing * or #. A second Return confirms.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is a service code (for example call forwarding). Press Return again to send it to your phone."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das ist ein Dienstcode (z. B. eine Rufumleitung). Drücken Sie erneut Return, um ihn an Ihr Telefon zu senden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not available yet. For now, Pickup controls your calls from the Mac while the conversation stays on your phone.": {
      "comment": "Tooltip of the disabled \"Take calls on this Mac\" setting.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
